<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS4" title="In 4. Findings ‣ Can LLMs Address Mental Health Questions? A Comparison with Human Therapists" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.4 </span>Authorship Judgment</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS5" title="In 4. Findings ‣ Can LLMs Address Mental Health Questions? A Comparison with Human Therapists" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.5 </span>User Preferences and Therapist Recommendation</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Can LLMs Address Mental Health Questions? A Comparison with Human Therapists" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Discussion</span></a>
